  "description": "Hong Kang Yoo has always been unlucky since birth to the point that even her parents passed away... On the verge of dying, she meets Woo Ahm, a mountain god. He tells her that if she doesn't do something about her misfortune she will die. In order to be saved, Kang Yoo needs to make a pact with him.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=685460), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=2461986)  \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/LOVE/fenghuangniepan/list?title_no=888), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/drama/fenghuangniepan/list?title_no=893)",
